# The last pool. Every rule the game has: a refusing arrow, an arrow you must aim
# down, a corridor that only fills backwards, a cross serving three ways, and two
# thirsts that each cost a dead-end branch. Nothing new is introduced - level 24
# is the exam, not the lesson. The tide is generous on purpose.
